<StaticPage title="Terms of use" deck="Basic terms for using the OGCTV website." eyebrow="Legal" updated="6 October 2026"><h2>Using OGCTV</h2><p>You may read and share links to OGCTV coverage for personal, non-commercial use. Do not reproduce complete articles, images or video without permission. Short quotations should be attributed and linked to the original page.</p><h2>Accuracy and availability</h2><p>OGCTV aims for accurate, timely reporting, but developing stories can change. The website may be unavailable temporarily for maintenance or technical reasons. Nothing on this site constitutes legal, financial or medical advice.</p><h2>User submissions</h2><p>When you send a tip or media, you confirm that you have the right to share it. Submission does not guarantee publication. The newsroom may verify, edit or decline material and should discuss any intended use with the sender where appropriate.</p><h2>Demonstration content</h2><p>During launch preparation, sample stories are clearly labelled. They illustrate product structure and are not claims about current events.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>These terms should be reviewed by the organisation and qualified counsel before a production launch. Changes will be dated on this page.</p></StaticPage>
